# Unity Echoes — QA Test File Rules

1. Put logic tests in `EditMode/`, runtime flows in `PlayMode/`.
2. PlayMode: call `BddTestSceneFactory.Reset()` in SetUp and TearDown.
3. Follow TC naming + GDD comment headers used in `GddPositiveBddIntegrationTests`.
4. Extend factory helpers instead of duplicating GameObject wiring.
5. Use `[UnityTest]` + `IEnumerator` only when frames/physics/UI time matter.
6. Never assign `[Category("DemoAI")]` to product regression tests.
7. New test scripts need valid `.meta` (32-char GUID).
8. Keep asmdef references intact; don’t auto-reference test assemblies into runtime.
9. Asserts: NUnit constraints (`Assert.That`) consistent with existing suites.
10. If adding categories for filtering, document CI impact on `unity_qa.yml`.
